            "text": "Vertical baseline data is stamped on each run rather than inferred later from the element. Columns and text-combine cells are distinct inline runs in Blink; carrying the measured FontMetrics ascent on both segment shapes lets rendering remain correct if run styling diverges while preserving the element-level field for old captures.",
