          "message": {
            "text": "The old Tamil ZWJ+U+0BC6 exception was a sampled sequence. HarfBuzz shaping machines give ZWJ/ZWNJ their joiner category independent of script, so they preserve (rather than create) the base state; unrelated Cf characters remain outside this rule.",
            "markdown": "The old Tamil ZWJ+U+0BC6 exception was a sampled sequence. HarfBuzz shaping machines give ZWJ/ZWNJ their joiner category independent of script, so they preserve (rather than create) the base state; unrelated Cf characters remain outside this rule."
          },
