                  "endLine": 200,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "// ZWJ/ZWNJ are the shaping machines' `Z` category and are transparent to the\n// base/no-base state. Do not generalize this to every Format character: bidi\n// controls and other Cf scalars are removed/itemized by different stages.\nexport const isShapingTransparentControl = (ch) => ch === \"\\u200C\" || ch === \"\\u200D\";"
