          "message": {
            "text": "Computed math-auto is the activation key, not the mi tag alone. Blink's UA rule disables the transform for mathvariant=normal; the browser-backed DM-2441 matrix proves ASCII/Greek/h/direct-supplementary/CSS-italic mappings while preserving that normal control.",
            "markdown": "Computed math-auto is the activation key, not the mi tag alone. Blink's UA rule disables the transform for mathvariant=normal; the browser-backed DM-2441 matrix proves ASCII/Greek/h/direct-supplementary/CSS-italic mappings while preserving that normal control."
